# Vercel Web Analytics Installation Report

## Summary
Verified and confirmed that Vercel Web Analytics is already properly installed and configured in this Next.js project according to the latest official Vercel documentation (fetched on July 1, 2026).

## Current Implementation Status

### ✅ Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/analytics` version ^2.0.1
- **Location**: Listed in `package.json` dependencies
- **Status**: Already installed and up-to-date

### ✅ Configuration
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.2.6 with App Router
- **Implementation File**: `frontend/src/app/layout.tsx`
- **Integration**: Analytics component properly imported and configured

### Implementation Details

The Analytics component is correctly integrated in the root layout:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/next';

export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>
        <AppProvider>
          {children}
        </AppProvider>
        <SpeedInsights />
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

This implementation matches the official Vercel documentation specifications:
1. ✅ Imported from `@vercel/analytics/next` (Next.js-specific package)
2. ✅ Placed inside the `<body>` tag in the root layout
3. ✅ Located in `app/layout.tsx` (App Router structure)

