## Additional Configuration Present

The project also includes Vercel Speed Insights (`@vercel/speed-insights` version ^2.0.0), which is configured alongside Analytics for comprehensive performance monitoring.

## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable Web Analytics on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your project in the Vercel dashboard
2. Go to the Analytics tab
3. Click "Enable" to activate Web Analytics
4. Deploy the project using `vercel deploy`
5. Once deployed, verify the setup by checking the Network tab in your browser for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`

## Conclusion

No code changes were necessary. The project already has Vercel Web Analytics properly installed and configured according to the latest official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will start tracking analytics data once enabled in the Vercel dashboard and deployed.
